# AGENTS Index

**Role:** identity + skills/agents inventory + pointers. **Not:** policy SoT, Design SoT, flag encyclopedia, or milestone tracker.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintAgentsDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `\bM\d+\b`, changelog voice, long CLI fixture dumps
- Normative exit-code tables → cli-reference; gate/commit/YAGNI prose → rules/skills
- Design SoT detail / fragile catalogs / UX laundry lists

## Allowed

- `HOTSPOT-*` only as pointer to feature-planning naming
- Skills/agents tables; short pointers to ARCHITECTURE, DOC-OWNERSHIP, TESTING, ROADMAP/STATE, cli-reference, hooks

## Sync

Update only when identity or inventory changes. Policy text lives in SoTs.
